<title>USA: Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderate. Compared with Thursday, barrows and gilts again were $0.50 lower. Top $52.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     52.50</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     52.00-52.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     50.00-51.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     48.00-49.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs     43.00</p>
<p>		   400-450 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs     53.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs     54.00</p>
</text>
